@startuml AD-04_RealTime_AI_Surveillance
title AD-04: Real-time AI-powered Surveillance Activity Diagram (WF-4)\nCampus Security Surveillance System (FA26SE040)

skinparam conditionStyle inside
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF2CC
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #D6B656
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4A5568
skinparam PartitionBorderColor #4A5568
skinparam PartitionBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #EBF8FF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #3182CE

|#E3F2FD|Camera & Ingestion|
start
:Capture RTSP live video stream via MediaMTX;
:Deliver frame to Zero-Lag Buffer (Buffer Size = 1);

|#FFF3E0|AI Surveillance Engine (ai-service)|
:Grab fresh frame & preprocess\n(Letterbox Resize 640x640, BGR to RGB);
:Detect humans via YOLO11n\n& Track continuously via ByteTrack (Track ID);

if (Person's bottom-center inside ROI Polygon?\n(Ray-Casting Algorithm)) then (yes)
  if (Track ID already verified in cache?) then (yes)
    :Reuse cached authorization status;
  else (no: New subject / Uncached)
    :Crop upper-body & detect face/landmarks\nvia OpenCV YuNet ONNX;
    if (Face detected and quality sufficient?) then (yes)
      :Extract 512-D L2-Normalized Embedding\nvia ArcFace ResNet-50 ONNX;
      :Cosine Similarity Search against\nIn-Memory Vector RAM Cache;
      if (Similarity >= Threshold (0.65)?) then (yes)
        :Identify User / Guest Code;
        |#E8F5E9|System Backend Core & Storage|
        :Evaluate Waterfall Authorization Rules\nvia AccessDecisionService;
        note right
          1. Check Area Level (PUBLIC / RESTRICTED)
          2. Check Assigned Personnel
          3. Check Access Level vs Area Level
          4. Check Active Area Event Schedule
          5. Check Incident Response (Guard on duty)
          6. Check Active Access Request / Guest Visit
        end note
      else (no: Unmatched)
        |#FFF3E0|AI Surveillance Engine (ai-service)|
        :Classify as UNKNOWN_PERSON;
        :Check Campus Zone & Time Policy;
      endif
    else (no / timeout > 1.5s)
      |#FFF3E0|AI Surveillance Engine (ai-service)|
      :Classify as UNKNOWN_PERSON;
      :Check Campus Zone & Time Policy;
    endif
    |#FFF3E0|AI Surveillance Engine (ai-service)|
    :Cache identity & authorization result for this Track ID;
  endif

  |#FFF3E0|AI Surveillance Engine (ai-service)|
  if (Is entry authorized?) then (yes)
    :Display green bounding box (Authorized Access);
    |#E8F5E9|System Backend Core & Storage|
    :Write CameraAccessLog (Result: ALLOWED);
    stop
  else (no: Violation / Unauthorized)
    |#FFF3E0|AI Surveillance Engine (ai-service)|
    :Display red bounding box (Security Violation);
    :Classify Incident Violation Type\n(UNAUTHORIZED_ACCESS / INTRUSION / UNKNOWN_PERSON);

    ' ===== PARALLELISM 1: AI PARALLEL TASKS (FORK) =====
    fork
      :Trigger Incident Stream Recording (.mp4);
    fork again
      :Capture & upload high-res evidence snapshot\nto MinIO (SSE-S3 AES-256);
      :Publish alert event to Apache Kafka\n(Topic: security-incidents);
    end fork

    |#E8F5E9|System Backend Core & Storage|
    :Kafka Consumer ingests event\n(Idempotency Key Check);

    ' ===== CORE ENTITY LIFECYCLE STATE: NEW =====
    :[<b>Object State</b>]\nSecurityIncident: <b>NEW</b>; <<#LightYellow>>

    ' ===== PARALLELISM 2: SYSTEM PARALLEL DISPATCH (FORK 3 NHÁNH) =====
    fork
      :Write CameraAccessLog (Result: DENIED);
    fork again
      :Create IncidentEscalation record;
    fork again
      :Dispatch real-time WebSocket alerts:\n• Targeted: /topic/guards/{id}/alerts\n• Building: /topic/buildings/{code}/alerts\n• Global: /topic/security-alerts;
    end fork

    stop
  endif

else (no)
  |#FFF3E0|AI Surveillance Engine (ai-service)|
  :Update ByteTrack trajectory in RAM\n(Outside ROI / Normal state);
  detach
endif

@enduml
